WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:08.560
Le vidiyo inikeza isingeniso esifushane kudivayisi ye-Arclight.

2
00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.520
Ivule usebenzisa le nkinobho empunga.

3
00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:18.440
Ekuqaleni, zombili iziphetho ze-Arclight zingavela ngasikhathi sinye.

4
00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:24.580
Uma ingakhanyisi nhlobo noma izibani zilufifi, ibhethri lingase libe flat.

5
00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:27.360
Yixhume usebenzisa ishaja ye-USB.

6
00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:31.240
Uma ishaja, amalambu aluhlaza azokhanya.

7
00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:37.510
Ngemuva kwemizuzu engu-15, kufanele ishajwe ngokugcwele futhi isebenze amahora ambalwa.

8
00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:41.390
Ukuyishiya ekukhanyeni kwelanga kuzogcina ibhethri lishajiwe.

9
00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:44.970
Ngeke udinge ukushintsha noma yimaphi amabhethri noma ama-bulb.

10
00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:49.090
Imodi lapho zombili iziphetho zifika ngeyokusetshenziswa okuvamile.

11
00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:54.980
Shintshela kumodi yamehlo ngokubamba inkinobho phansi imizuzwana engu-15.

12
00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:59.920
Bese uphakamisa iminwe yakho bese ucindezela ngokushesha futhi njengoba ukukhanya kukhanya.

13
00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:04.560
Manje ukumodi yamehlo, lapho kuzovela khona i-ophthalmoscope

14
00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:07.940
okokuqala, bese kuba i-loupe ingxenye yangaphambili.

15
00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:13.960
Ukuphinda lezi zinyathelo kuzozungeza izindlela ezintathu ezihlukene zokusebenzisa.

16
00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:15.740
Ukusetshenziswa okujwayelekile, amehlo, bese kuba nezindlebe.

17
00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:20.080
Uma usuyikhethile imodi oyincamelayo, ucindezela inkinobho empunga

18
00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:25.520
kushintsha indlela izibani ezikhanya ngayo nokuthi yikuphi ukuphela okukhanyisiwe.

19
00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:30.140
Qiniseka ukuthi usebenzisa isiphetho esifanele ukuhlola okulungile.

20
00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:34.700
Iso langaphandle lihlolwa ngokusebenzisa i-loupe.

21
00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:41.140
Ukubuka kuzocaca uma usondelene kakhulu neso cishe ngo-6 cm.

22
00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:48.300
I-fundal reflex yenziwa ngobude bengalo kusetshenziswa i-ophthalmoscope eqondile.

23
00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:53.740
Uma ukubuka kufiphele, bheka ukuthi i-lens rack iphezulu.

24
00:01:54.160 --> 00:02:00.540
Kulesi simo, ayikho ilensi embobeni yokubona futhi i-reflex kufanele icace.

25
00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:50.180
I-Arclight ingasetshenziswa futhi ukuthwebula ividiyo yezimpawu zomtholampilo

26
00:02:50.180 --> 00:02:53.760
uma ixhunywe kwikhamera yeselula.

27
00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:57.810
Uma isinamathiselwe, imbobo yokubona ye-ophthalmoscope eqondile

28
00:02:58.380 --> 00:03:05.920
izobekwa ngokuqondile phakathi nendawo yelensi esetshenziswa ikhamera yakho yeselula kumodi yevidiyo.

29
00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:11.800
Ikhamera izosebenza njengamehlo akho uma ubuka ngembobo yokubona.

30
00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:15.720
Ukuqinisekisa ukuthi iyiphi ilensi ongamisa ngayo imbobo yokubona,

31
00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:21.760
vula uhlelo lokusebenza lwevidiyo ocingweni lwakho, beka umunwe wakho phezu kwelensi ngayinye ngokushintshana.

32
00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:27.100
Uma isikrini siba mnyama, uvale ilensi esetshenziselwa ividiyo.

33
00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:31.960
Susa iphepha eliphuzi ngemuva kwesiqeshana.

34
00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:38.180
Beka amaphoyinti omcibisholo phakathi nendawo yelensi esetshenziselwa ukuthwebula ividiyo.

35
00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:41.040
Cindezela isiqeshana phansi ngokuqinile.

36
00:03:41.870 --> 00:03:43.150
Susa umcibisholo.

37
00:03:44.210 --> 00:03:47.410
Isiqeshana kufanele manje sibe sesimweni esifanele.

38
00:03:47.650 --> 00:03:51.470
Ukuze wenze ividiyo ye-reflex, vula i-ophthalmoscope eqondile

39
00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:56.770
ekugcineni kwe-Arclight bese ukhetha ukukhanya okugqama kakhulu ngokuchofoza kathathu.

40
00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:59.310
Qinisekisa ukuthi i-lens rack iphezulu.

41
00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:03.820
Njengoba ukukhanya kubheke kude nefoni kuya esigulini,

42
00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:09.840
beka i-Arclight kusiqeshana bese udonsa ukunwebeka ukuze uvikeleke.

43
00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:14.840
Phusha i-Arclight phezulu ize ingakwazi ukuslayida ngokuqhubekayo.

44
00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:17.380
Imbobo yokubona ye-ophthalmoscope eqondile

45
00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:23.560
manje izoba maphakathi nendawo yelensi ethwebula ividiyo.

46
00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:28.460
Ukuze urekhode iso langaphandle, sebenzisa esinye isiphetho sedivayisi.

47
00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:34.160
Ukuze uthwebule izithombe, vula uhlelo lokusebenza lwevidiyo futhi usondeze isithombe,

48
00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:38.020
ukugcwalisa isikrini ngokubuka ngembobo yokubona.

49
00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:41.000
Cindezela irekhodi bese wenza ukuhlola.

50
00:04:41.480 --> 00:04:43.220
Cindezela okuthi misa bese ulondoloza ividiyo.

51
00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:48.200
Manje usungabelana nozakwenu ezinkundleni zokuxhumana ezivikelekile, ezibethelwe

52
00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:53.260
kuphela ngenjongo othole ngayo imvume esigulini.

53
00:05:16.990 --> 00:05:19.890
Jabulela ukusebenzisa i-Arclight emsebenzini wakho.
